speechtext:
There is an amendment to this section. As it appears in the bill it indicates clearly that the penalties imposed shall be computed in respect of each such article, as though each such article had been the subject of a separate complaint. I shall ask my colleague to move:
That section 12 be amended by the insertion at the beginning thereof of the following words: "Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in section 11 hereof contained";
and that the word "shall" in the second line be changed to "may";
and that there be added after the word "shall" in the fifth line the word "then".
